  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nSpawning from @reivilibre getting a spurious Riot branded email, https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/11295#issuecomment-1148814575\r\n\r\nCould be useful to monitor how much of each `app_name` we're emailing about. I think we would expect zero (or close to zero) `Riot` and `Vector` emails going out. Would be a good signal to see if we're doing something wrong there.\r\n",
